COMMENT ON COLUMN market.listing.currency_code IS 'The quote currency of THIS listing on THIS venue. The normalized fact: Camtek is USD on Nasdaq and ILS on Tel Aviv, and both are true. security.currency_code cannot express that, which is how a provider''s USD claim for a Jakarta listing overwrote its rupiah.';


